## Language

- language: en

Read as a field, not as prose: `wrap-report.sh` parses the first `language:`
line in this file and uses it as the document's `<html lang>` when no explicit
`--lang` is passed. Precedence is `--lang` > this field > `en`.

Scope is ARTIFACTS only. `.context/` stays English (D-04) whatever this says —
it is a historical record and is cheaper to search in one language — and
`communications/` bodies stay in the language they arrived in. This field
exists so a project whose reader wants Spanish reports configures it once here
instead of restating it per request.
